{"id":"H0265","lemma":"אֲחוֹחַ","transliteration":"achoach","sayIt":"a-cho-ach","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ahoah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 2Sa.23.9;\nson of: Bela (H1106A);\nbrother of: Ard (H0714H), Naaman (H5283H), Ezbon (H0675H), Uzzi (H5813I), Uzziel (H5816I), Jerimoth (H3406), Iri (H5901), Addar (H0146H), Gera (H1617I), Abihud (H0031) and Abishua (H0050H); also called Ahoah at 1Ch.8.4;\nAlso named: a.cho.chi (אֲחוֹחִי \"Ahohite\" H0266)\n§ Ahoah = \"brother of rest\"\na grandson of Benjamin","glosses":["ahoah"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahoah","kjv":"and Ahoah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:4","note":"Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0266","lemma":"אֲחוֹחִי","transliteration":"achochi","gloss":"Ahohite"},{"id":"H0031","lemma":"אֲבִיהוּד","transliteration":"avihud","gloss":"Abihud"},{"id":"H0050","lemma":"אֲבִישׁוּעַ","transliteration":"avishua","gloss":"Abishua"},{"id":"H0146","lemma":"אַדָּר","transliteration":"addar","gloss":"Addar"},{"id":"H1106","lemma":"בֶּ֫לַע","transliteration":"bela","gloss":"Bela"},{"id":"H0714","lemma":"אַרְדְּ","transliteration":"ard","gloss":"Ard"},{"id":"H5283","lemma":"נַעֲמָן","transliteration":"naaman","gloss":"Naaman"},{"id":"H0675","lemma":"אֶצְבּוֹן","transliteration":"etsbon","gloss":"Ezbon"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}